### name: lim.prefix-depth-does-not-shift-parens
--- note
The prefix counter is entered only when a prefix operator is actually consumed,
so it must not move the trip point for anything else. This is lim.parse-depth's
expectation restated as a regression guard: if adding prefix counting had cost
every expression a level, this case would fail and lim.parse-depth would too.
--- source
((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((1))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))
--- expect
error E_DEPTH at 1:101
===
